WEBVTT

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:02.780
Chara-su!

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.620
Is everyone shugo-peppy today?

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.150
Let's start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.710
Memorize our dance with us!

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.230
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:13.820
Unlock!

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:45.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:51.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.300
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:59.140
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:02.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:12.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:22.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:30.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:49.550
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:52.500
"Chin, Ton, Shan!"

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.510
Ya fell for it, ya fell for it!

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:00.810
Damn you Il!

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.010
Temari, reform Il for us!

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.140
Please!

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:07.130
Understood.

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:11.980
I shall impart to Il-san the ways of a Yamato
Nadeshiko, the ideal Japanese woman...

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:14.570
Yamato Nadeshiko Great Plan One
Ikebana

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:14.570
Chin, ton, shan!

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:17.600
First, I will teach you Ikebana,
Japanese flower arrangement.

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:20.130
Keh! As if I'd be caught
doing <i>that</i>!

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:21.370
Finished!

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:24.160
Ooh, that's Miki for you!

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.350
I have also finished!

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:28.830
Aloha!

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:31.670
Nice!

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.250
Yamato Nadeshiko Great Plan Two
Haiku

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:34.690
Chin, ton, shan!

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:38.410
Haiku are formed from
5, 7, and 5 syllables.

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:40.210
They should express
a Japanese cha-

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:44.950
R-Ran-san, you go
first, please.

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:45.720
'Kay!

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:49.430
Flowers blossoming!
Look at the really pretty
flowers blossoming!

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:51.790
I may have forgotten
to mention this,

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:55.650
but a haiku must contain a seasonal word
that represents one of the four seasons.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.580
Like spring or summer?

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.880
It seems quite difficult...

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.140
Finished!

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:04.870
Ah, it is now spring
Summer and fall both pass by
Now it is winter

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:09.030
Ooh, wow! All four seasons
were included!

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:10.180
She did it!

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.350
That's a four-pointer!

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:13.390
Amazing, right?

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:14.760
This is easy!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:19.540
I do request that
you cease such tomfoolery
from now on, if you please.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:20.560
Too many syllables...

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:23.760
Yamato Nadeshiko Great Plan Three
Tea Ceremony

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.760
Chin, ton, shan!

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:25.100
Please.

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:28.300
It's sweet and delicious!

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:29.050
Not bad!

00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:30.660
Huh? Sweet?

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:35.050
Yes! I added in milk to make
it easier to drink.

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:39.340
Now see here people, have you perhaps
forgotten the purpose of this exercise?

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:41.290
Purpose?

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:43.090
I'm headin' home.

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:44.320
Wait please!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.550
My legs are...

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:47.680
...numb!

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.640
That's about enough!

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:58.590
Oh, I'm pretty good at that.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:03.300
Temari, do something!

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:07.410
Chin-, -ton-, -shan
Ya-ma-to-Na-de-shi-ko
Sa-yo-u-na-ra!

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.230
You didn't include
a seasonal word.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.760
See you again!

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:16.700
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!
Character Transformations!

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.420
Our first Character Transformation is...

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.150
Black Lynx!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:27.280
Black Lynx is the form that Ikuto takes
when he transforms with Yoru!

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:32.340
His special attack uses the sharp
claws on his hand, Slash Claw!

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:36.270
He's got cat ears and a long
tail, with a punk outfit!

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:38.810
A wild, sexy black-cat character!

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:40.460
Cool, don't you think?

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.330
And the second transformation is...

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:54.150
Samurai Soul!

00:04:55.340 --> 00:05:00.060
Samurai Soul is the form that Kairi takes
when he transforms with Musashi!

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:04.420
His special attack uses two
katanas, Inazuma Blade!

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:07.240
He wears an angel's raiment
like Ushiwakamaru,

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:10.280
and wields Japanese swords.
A samurai character!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:11.280
Cool, yeah!

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:18.920
Shugo Character Encyclopedia
will continue each week!

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:21.240
Look forward to it!

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:26.490
Shugo-shugo Dance Lesson!

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:30.260
Let's split up "Thank you, I'm so grateful!"
into 4 parts and memorize it!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.260
Today it's Lesson One!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:34.790
First, look at the Egg's example:

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:41.050
kinou to wa chigau jibun ni

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:43.370
Let's try doing this much together!

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:45.880
Spin your hand around...

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:47.490
...and do the "chara-su!" pose!

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:51.150
Make a big heart, and then little heart beats!

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:56.160
Okay? Now try dancing to the music!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:02.410
kinou to wa chigau jibun ni

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:03.750
Did you do it?

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.210
Then, let's look at the next step!

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:15.230
kitto nareru yo hoppu suteppu de janpu

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:19.160
(instrumental break)

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:22.190
Let's try this section together!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.870
Shake your hips to the side...

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:25.450
1-2-3!

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:27.300
Add your hands... 1-2-3!

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:29.800
Once more... 1-2-3!

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:33.580
Point your finger three times... Blow a kiss!

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.730
Wag, wag, wag...

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:40.050
Jump, jump! Jump, jump, jump!

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:42.800
Now, try dancing it again to the music!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:50.540
kitto nareru yo hoppu suteppu de janpu

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:54.690
(instrumental break)

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:59.150
Okay! Finally, let's try doing
the whole lesson at once!

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.340
You can do it!

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:09.190
kinou to wa chigau jibun ni

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:16.540
kitto nareru yo hoppu suteppu de janpu

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:20.700
(instrumental break)

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.050
That's all for today.

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:25.450
Good luck with the continuation
next time!

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:33.690
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:36.430
"Taking an Afternoon Nap!"

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:44.440
What's the matter, Miki?

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.490
I'm sort of...

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:48.390
Bored! Bored! Bored!

00:07:48.390 --> 00:07:50.680
Is there anything to do?

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:51.960
To do?

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:54.030
How about we have a snack?

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:55.050
I'm not hungry.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:56.400
Then, draw a sketch?

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:58.040
Did that already.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.780
That's it! You should take a nap
at times like this, you know?

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:02.900
An afternoon nap?

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:03.420
Yeah!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:07.520
You can get over times like "Bored!
Bored! Bored!" by going to sleep!

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.530
THEN LET US GO OUTSIDE!

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:22.110
I can't go to sleep so easily...

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:25.550
It's a pretty butterfly!

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:27.270
What's the matter?

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.270
You've got to take a nap!

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:31.870
Sorry... But I'm not sleepy.

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:36.090
It's simple. Just lay down and
close your eyes, and then...

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:42.170
See? You're getting sleepy...

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:47.330
Wait... When I washed my hands before,
I feel like I left the tap on...

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.450
I've got to check!

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:51.740
Su, what about the
afternoon nap?

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:53.440
Oh, right...

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:57.730
You two are hopeless. I'll cheer on
your afternoon napping to help!

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:01.310
Yay, yay, Miki, Su! Sleepy,
sleepy, Miki, Su!

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.740
Deep sleep, Deep
sleep, Miki, Su!

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.230
You're so loud I can't sleep!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:09.800
It doesn't seem like we
can get to sleep.

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:13.820
All right then! Let's refuse to open
our eyes no matter what!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.710
Even if it's snack time?

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:16.170
Yeah!

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:17.580
Or if it starts to rain?

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:18.930
Right! No matter what!

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:23.310
Got it. If we're that serious about it,
we've got to be able to get to sleep.

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:28.100
But I'm just not sleepy...

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:30.130
The tap...

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.920
Now that I got some exercise
I'm even less sleepy...

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:37.350
But we promised not
to open our eyes...

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:40.320
If I open them secretly,
they'll get mad at me...

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:42.500
What am I going to do?
I can't get to sleep...

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:43.500
What am I going to do?

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:44.890
What am I going to do?

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.100
What to do?

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.880
What to do?

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.770
See you again!

00:09:57.370 --> 00:10:01.160
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:04.540
Today's episode is "Hikaru and
the Fun Amusement Park!"

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.580
Hikaru-kun will ride
a roller coaster?

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:10.700
He'd set foot on a
Merry-Go-Round?

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:12.250
I can't imagine it!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.250
Not in the slightest!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:28.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:32.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:42.820
Since I met you I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:48.350
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:53.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:58.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:06.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:12.290
I have something to say.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:18.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:24.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:29.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:36.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.970
22 - Hikaru and the
Fun Amusement Park

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:53.560
Ack, this is bad! I'm
gonna be late!

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.840
Hey, out of my way, move it!

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:57.730
I said move it!

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:00.930
Hotaru, let's go!

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:06.660
Come on, let's go.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:07.720
Right!

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:20.300
Hurry up, Hotaru!

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.230
Right!

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:27.180
Everyone's late...

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:28.620
That's true.

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:43.140
What the heck is that?

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:46.400
It's really popular with us Guardian
Characters lately!

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:47.480
Sounds fun!

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:48.700
I'll do it, too!

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:03.970
That was fun!

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:10.020
Wait, don't you think that
was funny, Hikaru?

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:10.590
What was?

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:13.340
"Dadashiko" is funny, right?

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.770
I suppose the rhythm
is intriguing.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:17.680
Then try laughing, huh?

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:18.980
Why?

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:21.650
You laugh at strange
things, you know?

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.830
Laughter is nothing more than
a release of tension.

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:29.990
I have simply never experienced
such an occasion as of yet.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:33.380
Will you stop with all
the mumbo-jumbo?

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:36.940
You mean you've never really
laughed out loud?

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:37.750
No.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:42.220
Well, Hikaru does give
off that vibe...

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:44.290
I'm afraid I must agree...

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.090
It's not surprising.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:48.070
I do not do unnecessary things.

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:48.930
That is all.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:57.980
On to the next!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:05.690
I'm tired...

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:07.240
He's a tough one...

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:09.690
I do not do unnecessary things.

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:12.000
But laughing is fun!

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:12.740
Fun?

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:15.440
Right! It's fun because you laugh.

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:16.910
And you laugh because it's fun.

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:19.360
It's fun to laugh?

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:27.310
That <i>is</i> laughing, yes...

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:29.630
But it's an <i>evil</i>, scary laugh...

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:31.110
That wasn't fun at all.

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:33.480
Yeah, I suppose so...

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:38.930
I believe that if he is truly having fun from the
bottom of his heart, Hikaru-san would laugh.

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:43.110
That's it! Hikaru-kun, would you
hang out with me this Sunday?

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:47.620
And so, Sunday!

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:49.280
And so, amusement park!

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:52.640
But this amusement park
is shut down, remember?

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.640
We're gonna sneak
in <i>again</i>?

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.180
What?

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:07.560
Easter purchased this.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:09.760
We're going to start operations
again shortly.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.490
Whoa...

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:13.920
That's Easter for you!

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:20.100
I could never believe it worked to put X's on
children's hearts just a little while ago!

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:33.020
All right! We're gonna have
a ton of fun today!

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:34.990
Since we're together with
the owner of the place!

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:36.750
First off, the ferris wheel!

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:38.490
Yeah!

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:42.760
Wow! I can see the entire
amusement park!

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:47.630
I have a lot of fun memories
of this place.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:49.460
So that's why I wanted
you to have fun, too.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:53.510
Understood. I will attempt to enjoy myself
to the extent of your expectation.

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:55.800
I'm not sure you have
the right idea...

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.360
Hotaru-chan, don't you want
to look at the view?

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.010
Hotaru, what's the matter?

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:04.280
Not feeling well?

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:06.690
Y-You see, I...

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:10.190
I-I am scared of heights!

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.840
Even though you're a
Guardian Character?

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:14.530
And you can fly?

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:18.830
I am okay about as high as
Rikka-chan's height, but...

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:20.580
Up this high, I...

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:29.440
There, there, it'll be okay.

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:30.660
It looks like...

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:33.380
...Hotaru's got an unexpected
weak point.

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:38.300
Hotaru, you don't have
to force yourself...

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:41.810
N-No, please do not worry
yourself about me...

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:46.170
I-I am Rikka-chan's...

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:51.280
G-G-G-Guardian C-Character,
after all...

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:00.810
Ooh, that was fun!

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:03.250
What about you, Hikaru-kun?

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:04.620
Not particularly...

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:10.060
Then on to the next challenge!

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:12.210
When did this become
a competition?

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:17.670
Are you okay?

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:19.420
I love going fast.

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:20.850
Now, attack from the inside!

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.150
Amu-chan spotted!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:25.770
Not good enough.

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:29.350
Say what?! Then next challenge
is the house of mirrors!

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:30.890
House of Mirrors

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.760
That's a funny face!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:39.220
You too, Su.

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:44.330
I see... So the mirrors
are warped...

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:48.070
Let's take a time out.
I need a break.

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:50.600
What? Let's play more!

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:52.450
You're sure full of energy, Rikka-chan.

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:56.400
Now that I think about it, we've
forgotten why we came here.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.300
Hikaru, you won't
laugh, will you?

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:00.610
You're not having fun?

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:02.680
No, I'm having a lot of fun.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:06.450
You both are trying to get
me to have fun, right?

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:09.860
So I must try my best
to have fun.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:12.730
Even so, you don't <i>look</i>
like you're having fun.

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:13.900
You can't tell?

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:16.000
This is my normal face.

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:18.580
This is my face when
I am sullen.

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:20.910
This is my face when
I'm having fun.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:23.000
They're exactly the same...

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:25.310
But lately...

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:28.460
I had thought he'd gotten
more expressive lately...

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:31.630
Then perhaps it's subconscious.

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:35.670
It's difficult to consciously express
a certain emotion, isn't it?

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:41.930
Then I suppose we just have to make you
have a lot of fun to get you to smile.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:44.100
Then, let's ride those next!

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:49.920
Ikuto...

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:53.080
Okay! Time for spinnin'!

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.760
Let's go!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:59.660
How is this fun?

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:00.490
You see...

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:02.190
You do it like this!

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:05.560
You try it too, Hikaru!

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:07.820
Like this?

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:11.280
Yes, that's right! Like that!

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:13.530
Wow!

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:16.100
You having fun, Hikaru?

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:20.020
Is this fun? I don't really
know anymore...

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:21.670
It's fun for me!

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:23.680
'Cause I'm with you, Hikaru!

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:26.680
That's right!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:32.380
Playing around in an amusement park
with someone is something fun.

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:34.150
I'm having a lot of fun, too!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.220
That was a blast...

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:51.790
I'm dizzy!

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:54.260
I'm still dizzy even though
we've gotten off...

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:55.540
Yeah...

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:57.410
My legs are all wobbly...

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:59.340
That is because we
spun too much...

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.940
Hikaru-kun, are you okay?

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:15.850
Hikaru?

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:21.590
You don't mean...

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:23.670
Maybe he hit his head?

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:25.930
Hikaru's broken!

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:27.530
I'm okay!

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:29.690
I don't hurt anywhere...

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:31.130
Then, why...

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:33.390
I can't control myself!

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:37.790
Not being able to move my
body like I want to...

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.700
I've never thought something
like that could happen!

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:41.420
So that's why you're laughing?

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:42.350
Right!

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.610
You think that's strange?

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:47.500
I think I can understand...

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:49.930
Spin, spin, spin, spin!

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:53.160
Okay! Everyone get dizzy!

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:06.280
I'm so dizzy!

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:10.320
I can't take it!

00:21:10.320 --> 00:21:11.530
I'm all wobbly!

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:17.540
Your smile is really
something, Hikaru.

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:22.250
I see... So this is a smile?

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:23.460
Hey!

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:26.330
Don't go thinking about
it seriously!

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:30.720
Okay.

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:37.770
Then, let's spin again!

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:39.750
Okay, let's go, Hikaru!

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:41.340
Here we go!

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:48.150
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:51.620
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:56.070
Which egg will be
the lucky one?

00:21:59.820 --> 00:22:01.890
Guardian Egg Friendship Fortune!

00:22:01.890 --> 00:22:04.250
First, for those of you who
chose Ran's egg...

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:07.200
4 Shugoluck stars,
Super Lucky!

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:10.650
This is a time when people will focus
on you and you'll gain popularity!

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:12.850
Smiles are the key
to happiness!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.320
Dia's egg is 3 Shugoluck stars.

00:22:15.320 --> 00:22:17.700
Try talking a bunch
with your friends!

00:22:15.320 --> 00:22:17.700
You'll be able to communicate well!

00:22:17.700 --> 00:22:19.570
Miki's egg is 2 Shugoluck stars.

00:22:19.570 --> 00:22:22.140
The teacher might get mad at you

00:22:19.570 --> 00:22:22.440
Don't go playing pranks
on your friends!

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:25.420
Finally, for those of you
who chose Su's egg...

00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:29.050
Ugwahwah, your luck's run out! One Shugoluck star!

00:22:29.050 --> 00:22:33.150
You might anger your friends by not
being straightforward with them!

00:22:33.150 --> 00:22:36.300
Make sure to get your opinion
across to them!

00:22:39.530 --> 00:22:41.380
Today sure was fun!

00:22:41.380 --> 00:22:43.590
See you for the next
Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:47.170
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:47.170 --> 00:22:48.860
Bye-bye!

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:20.040
Now's the time to make your move.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.690
Nothing will start if you start worrying.

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:27.110
A song to your lips!

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:30.830
Yeah! What're you waiting for?

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:33.610
Bang on this door to the world.

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:37.490
On whose terms?  That's right, ours!

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:43.020
Just trying to grasp success before you,

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:48.590
you're sure to become lost in the labyrinth.

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:55.670
Embrace the melody in your heart!

00:23:55.670 --> 00:24:00.830
Try singing it, try shouting it!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:11.640
Each time you get closer to who you
want to be, they'll be given birth:

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:14.260
Our Songs!
